    "title_en": "Rare Neutrino and Radiative Decays of Bottom Baryons in the Relativistic Quark Model",
    "abstract_en": "Rare neutrino and radiative decays of the $\\Lambda_{b}$ and $\\Xi_{b}$ bottom baryons are studied within the relativistic quark model based on the quasipotential approach and quantum chromodynamics. All relativistic effects are consistently taken into account. The branching ratios of the decays are obtained within the Standard Model. The values for the radiative-decay processes agree with available experimental data.",
